<title>USA: Lasermedics names CFO.</title>
<headline>Lasermedics names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SUGAR LAND, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lasermedics Inc said Thursday it had named Dan Sudduth as chief financial officer, succeeding Chike Ogboenyiya, who has been interim CFO for the past 12 months.</p>
<p>Sudduth will remain a director, and Ogboenyiya will continue to serve as vice president-finance and corporate secretary, the company said.</p>
<p>Sudduth was a merger and acquisition consultant for more than a year and has been a director for the company since January 1996, it said.</p>
